  "solution": {
    "text": "From Newton&#39;s second law<br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0086_87499094105f.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><br /><br />And <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><br /><br />After solving above equations, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>l</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>"
